    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a bird flying against a hoard of airplanes and other flying machines or creatures in this cartoon themed side-scroller. Eat mosquitos and fight a series of nasty aviators who think the sky is theirs to control. It's either you, or them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock skins for your favorite birds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937850/extras/6bbc8bad479422508e969c8539ffeb38.poster.avif?t=1750172430\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937850/extras/6bbc8bad479422508e969c8539ffeb38.webm?t=1750172430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937850/extras/6bbc8bad479422508e969c8539ffeb38.mp4?t=1750172430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight different bosses each having unique attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937850/extras/a1cc00f3d95b1dd1c75b7241fa9e670b.poster.avif?t=1750172430\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937850/extras/a1cc00f3d95b1dd1c75b7241fa9e670b.webm?t=1750172430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937850/extras/a1cc00f3d95b1dd1c75b7241fa9e670b.mp4?t=1750172430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get high scores and unlock upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937850/extras/e61d69798e2070b386a004c682fadd0b.avif?t=1750172430\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
